journey "Lightweight Client Portal"

mission:
  Map the client portal product at the repository level so agents can understand pages, API routes, and acceptance before editing code.

level: repo

children:
  - ./apis/leads.journey
  - ./pages/dashboard.journey
  - ./pages/settings.journey

pages:
  - Dashboard
  - Settings

apis:
  - Leads

flows:
  - A client lands on Dashboard, reviews active work, then adjusts preferences in Settings.
  - A lead capture form posts to the Leads API and receives a new lead status.

acceptance:
  - every visible page has a linked page journey
  - every API route has a linked API journey
  - agent handoffs include the product flow without requiring a running app

done when:
  - repo-level intent is clear
  - each page/API-level journey has purpose, rules, and acceptance
  - open questions are written down instead of hidden in code
